Create a function in Java for computing the factorial of a positive integer number.

### Response:
public static long factorial(int n) {
    if (n == 0) {
        return 1;
    }
    long result = 1;
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        result *= i;
    }
    return result;
}

